<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="title">今天，也要 好好吃饭。</view><view class="subtitle">从收藏的一道菜，到家里的一顿饭。</view><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">TODAY'S MENU</view><view class="title">今天吃什么？</view><view wx:if="{{!todayPlans.length}}" class="muted">还没安排，去日历选几道喜欢的菜吧。</view><view wx:for="{{todayPlans}}" wx:key="id" class="card" bindtap="openRecipe" data-id="{{item.recipeId}}"><view class="heading">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.meal}} · {{item.servings}} 人份</view></view></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary grow" id="action-shopping" bindtap="shopping">查看采购清单</button><button bindtap="importRecipe">收藏新菜</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">让喜欢的菜，出现在餐桌上</view><view class="note">已保存 {{count}} 道菜谱。安排一周菜单、核对家里食材，再开始做饭。</view></view><view wx:if="{{!count}}" class="actions"><button id="action-newRecipe" bindtap="newRecipe">新建第一道菜</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="loadDemo">加入演示菜谱</button></view></view>